[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Expressive Launcher 3.1.2 — FOSS Evolution, Obtainium & Streamlined Delivery[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][I]Official Release Announcement & Download Links[/I][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

Welcome to Expressive Launcher 3.1.2 (Build 44)! This release marks a pivotal evolution in how Expressive Launcher is delivered. We are embracing an open, friction-free FOSS distribution model—bringing first-class [B]Obtainium[/B] background updates, [B]IzzyOnDroid / F-Droid[/B] repository readiness, and complete transparency regarding our transition away from Google Play internal testing.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]📢 Important Distribution Update: Transition Away from Google Play Testing[/B][/SIZE]

To our testers and community members:
[LIST]
[*][B]The Challenge with Google Play:[/B] For personal developer accounts, Google Play Console enforces a policy requiring at least 20 testers opted-in continuously for 14 straight days before production access can even be reviewed. For a community-driven Android 17 launcher, this creates an artificial barrier and unnecessary delays. Furthermore, Google Play's billing policies conflict with our direct, privacy-respecting PayPal contributions and offline ECDSA P-256 Pro licensing.
[*][B]The Open Resolution:[/B] Moving forward, [B]GitHub Releases[/B], our built-in [B]In-App Updater[/B], and [B]Obtainium[/B] are our primary, official distribution channels. You will receive updates the instant they are built, with zero wait times, zero store gatekeeping, and full feature preservation.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New & Improved[/B][/SIZE]

1. [B]FOSS & IzzyOnDroid / F-Droid Inclusion Readiness (Closes #22)[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Configured full standard Fastlane metadata ([ICODE]fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/[/ICODE]) including titles, short/full descriptions, feature graphics, app icons, and per-version changelogs.
[*]Added [ICODE].fdroid.yml[/ICODE] in the repository root for automated crawler indexing, directly fulfilling community request #22 for open repository distribution.

[/LIST]
2. [B]Native Obtainium 1-Click Background Updates[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Added direct 1-click Obtainium integration ([ICODE]obtainium://add/https://github.com/denson9874/ExpressiveLauncher[/ICODE]) across the launcher:
[*]Under [B]Settings > About > Community[/B], tap [B]Add to Obtainium[/B] to immediately configure seamless background updates.
[*]Built-in graceful web fallback: if Obtainium is not installed yet on your device, tapping the link opens the official Obtainium download page in your browser.
[*]Added Obtainium install badges and setup instructions to [ICODE]README.md[/ICODE].

[/LIST]
3. [B]In-App Update Recovery & Fallback in Settings[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Enhanced [ICODE]UpdateSection.kt[/ICODE] with smart action prompts: when the launcher is up to date or if a network check encounters a connection timeout, the launcher now provides a 1-tap button to launch or configure Obtainium.
[*]Preserves offline resilience and ensures you always have an automated update path even if GitHub raw CDNs experience caching delays.

[/LIST]
4. [B]Streamlined Continuous Delivery Pipeline[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Decoupled heavy Google Play bundle uploads by default in our release orchestrator ([ICODE]release_unified.py[/ICODE]), cutting release cycle times from ~8 minutes to under 2 minutes.
[*]Hardened Jenkins feed verification in [ICODE]ci/publish_qa.py[/ICODE] with direct authenticated repository fallback when raw CDN caches take time to purge.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]💎 Expressive Pro & Free Core[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Free Core (Always Supported & 100% Free)[/B]:
[*]Clean, fluid Android 17 Pixel experience with 100% Pixel parity, private space support, and Google Discover feed integration via Expressive Feed Companion.
[*][B]Expressive Pro ($4.99 One-Time)[/B]:
[*]Unlocks deep personalization including custom grid sizing, typography, gesture mapping, dock styling, and per-app icon overrides.
[*]Powered by our 24/7 global serverless edge worker on Cloudflare and validated completely offline on your device with ECDSA P-256 cryptographic signatures.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

